==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Imperator Sael]] spawns after 4.67 seconds<sup>140f</sup>.
*1 [[Hyppoh]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Croco]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn, delay 16.67~18.67 seconds<sup>500f~560f</sup>.
**5 [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn, delay 6~8 seconds<sup>180f~240f</sup>.
**5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 6~8 seconds<sup>180f~240f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Croco]]s (400%) spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 23.33~25.33 seconds<sup>700f~760f</sup>.
**2 [[Maawth]]s spawn, delay 13.33~15.33 seconds<sup>400f~460f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An ordinary level akin in difficulty to any [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1 stage. Use long ranged attackers like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] to kill the Maawth, while your [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cats]] and/or [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cats]] handle everything else.

